//! HIR Builder — lowers AST to HIR with type resolution and desugaring.
//!
//! Entry point: `lower_module(ast, env) -> HirModule`.
//! Processes all top-level declarations, resolves types, desugars syntax,
//! and produces a fully-typed HirModule ready for THIR/MIR lowering.
//!
//! Phase 15a — items 2.1–2.6.

